# The AI rescue stick shares its tmux session with ttyd. ttyd-1.7.7-r1 is stable but accepts any
# libwebsockets >= 4.4 (the tree has 5.0.0 stable); -r2 is ~amd64 only and pins =libwebsockets-4.5*, the
# series ttyd was released against, so a build cannot pick a libwebsockets that ttyd does not build with.
=www-apps/ttyd-1.7.7-r2 ~amd64
# The live disc boots the newest Gentoo kernel, not the long-term one that is stable (the user's choice of 2026-10-28):
# it supports the newest hardware best, and installs follow the same series by default (system.kernel_series = newest).
# gentoo-kernel pulls virtual/dist-kernel of its own version.
sys-kernel/gentoo-kernel ~amd64
virtual/dist-kernel ~amd64
